OL,3,GNEWSAHomes evacuated in two separate
OL,4,Asecurity alerts
OL,5,
OL,6,FA number of homes have been evacuated
OL,7,Fin two separate security alerts.
OL,9,FResidents have been evacuated after
OL,10,Fpolice found "a number of suspicious
OL,11,Fdevices" during a search operation in
OL,12,Fwest Belfast on Friday morning.
OL,14,FA 35-year-old man who was arrested on
OL,15,Fsuspicion of offences under the
OL,16,FTerrorism Act, remains in police
OL,17,Fcustody.
OL,19,FMeanwhile, homes in Dervock in
OL,20,FBallymoney have also been evacuated as
OL,21,Fpolice attend a separate security
OL,22,Falert.
OL,23,APub: 30-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
